  "description": "Bafang 750W Rear Hub Motor\n\nThe JADE is powered by a Bafang 750W rear hub motor — a name synonymous with reliability and smooth power delivery. Paired with both cadence and speed sensors, it reads your riding input and responds with natural, intuitive assist that makes hills feel flat and long commutes feel effortless.\n\n48V 14Ah Samsung/LG Battery\n\nBuilt with premium Samsung and LG cells, the 48V 14Ah battery gives the JADE a range of 30 to 55 miles per charge depending on terrain and assist level. These cells are chosen for their long cycle life and consistent output — so performance doesn't fade over hundreds of charges the way cheaper batteries do.\n\n6061 Aluminum Step-Through Frame\n\nThe JADE's step-through frame is built from 6061 aluminum — lightweight, corrosion-resistant, and strong enough for daily urban use. The low-entry design makes it easy to mount and dismount at every stop, whether you're in work clothes, casual wear, or anything in between.\n\n180mm Hydraulic Disc Brakes\n\nLarge 180mm hydraulic disc brakes give the JADE serious stopping power that holds up in rain, heat, and heavy use. The larger rotor size means more braking surface and better heat dissipation — so you get firm, predictable stops every time without brake fade on longer descents or repeated braking in traffic.\n\nComfort-First Ride Setup\n\nThe JADE is built for riders who spend real time in the saddle. A VELO plush padded saddle with vinyl top cushions every bump, while 26\" x 2.125\" Kenda puncture-resistant tires keep you rolling smoothly over city streets without the stress of flats. Long commutes, short errands — either way, the ride stays comfortable.",
